e 8 (lines 24 to 29), omit paragraphs 31ABA(1)(b) to (d), substitute:* > >> *(b) for a child born on or after 1 July 2024—130 flexible PPL days for the child.* > > *(3) Schedule 1, item 12, page 9 (lines 11 to 16), omit paragraphs 31ABA(2)(b) to (d), substitute:* > >> *(b) for a child born on or after 1 July 2024—110 flexible PPL days for the child.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-8729","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-03-18/8"}
